cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AtmoTrack in published research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AtmoTrack: Atmospheric system tracking from ERA5 reanalysis data"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2024-01-01"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Argüeso
    given-names: Daniel
    email: d.argueso@uib.es
    affiliation: "Universitat de les Illes Balears"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2049-1890"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dargueso/AtmoTrack"
abstract: >
  AtmoTrack tracks atmospheric systems — Cut-Off Lows (COL),
  upper-level and surface cyclones/anticyclones, Mesoscale Convective
  Systems (MCS), and fronts — from ERA5 reanalysis data over a
  configurable geographic domain and time period.
keywords:
  - atmospheric-science
  - ERA5
  - cut-off-lows
  - cyclone-tracking
  - reanalysis
  - python
